  "result": "**No, the repo doesn't answer this.** The two-approval rule isn't implemented, and the same-person question is still open.\n\n- `docs/use-cases/UC-1-bulk-approval.md:17` says invoices over $1,000 need a second approver. Line 26 lists \"Can the same person be both approvers on a large invoice?\" as an open question.\n- `backend/src/InvoiceApp.Domain/ApprovalService.cs:31-41` has a single `Approve` that sets the invoice to Approved on one call. There is no approval count or second-approver check.\n\n\"Same person\" is not defined anywhere. The only identity in the code is the signed-in username, which `ApprovalsController` passes in as `approver` (`ApprovalsController.cs:23`). Comparing usernames is the likely basis, but nothing in the repo says so.",
